=== echo_reading ===
Book Keeper: I found an old story while sorting.
Echo joins you at the reading desk and opens the book.
A sibling away in a distant village wrote: ‘I miss you. I'll return when spring comes.’
From the date on the letter and news of the bridge repairs, the older sister found the way home. When spring came, they met again at the bridge.
